  "text": {
    "intro": "The Thorn Bottom foraging club keeps meticulous records, chiefly so that blame can be apportioned later.\nFive foragers are involved. Determine each forager's day and basket.\n- **Forager**: Ramiro, Eilish, Solomon, Annika and Tobias.\n- **Day** (listed from earlier to later): Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday and Friday.\n- **Basket**: a canvas satchel, an upturned hat, a string bag, a wicker trug and a tin pail.\nEvery forager has a different day and basket, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "Ramiro carries a string bag.",
      "Annika carries a wicker trug.",
      "Annika is exactly one day earlier than the forager who carries a canvas satchel, with no day in between. The forager who carries a canvas satchel is later than Wednesday in day order.",
      "The forager who carries a tin pail is later than Wednesday in day order.",
      "Monday is exactly one day earlier than Tobias, with no day in between.",
      "Eilish does not forage on Friday."
